Z||000003||BlackStang95||10-27-2001||12:05 PM||||an old 4 cylinder fiero in crap shape is all that he described.  The first time me and spek went to look at a fiero it was an 85 4 cylinder ( i think) that had been sitting a long time, was very dirty, black ass engine compartment with the huge air cleaner on top, bad transmission made it near impossible to shift...he nearly gave up on fieros forever.  I told him it wasn't fair to judge by that nasty car.  Tell that person to shut up until he drives a loaded gt in great condition.  Until then he is full of BS. ( i dont know how to do the cool smilie with the flag)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
