Z||000006||85ZainoGT||10-27-2001||01:51 PM||||lol... Is that coming from a "ricer type"?  When I bought my car, it wasnt in the greatest of shape either, if you give it some love, it does wonders, now I love my car... and all other fieros too... I wouldnt worry to much about that guy, mr2's are ugly!!!!!! yuk, I have a guy in my HS who HAS TO park next to me everyday at school... I asked him why one day, I like parkin nex to your car, its awesome... that was like the first compliment I got for my car...  When you talk to people who dont like fieros, your gonna get negative feedback, isnt that how it is for everything though?  you dont like something, 9x out of 10 you wont talk to great about it!.. good luck with the car you get and your supercharger triad!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Paul Ventimiglia<BR>1985 White/Silver GT <BR>2.8L 4 Speed LOADED :)<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sigpic2529_1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
