Z||000012||Monkeyman||10-27-2001||06:27 PM||||Funny thing about most of us Fieroholics is that it doesn't matter what the condition of our Fiero is, we still love our car and the other 370,000 of 'em.  My 1<sup>st</sup> Fiero was a POS.  The suspension was about thisfar from being dangerous, the motor ran terribly, and the interior was just about shot.  Most things didn't work but that didn't deter me from my passion.  Now I'm on my 4<sup>th</sup> Fiero and still loving every minute of it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>If he really doesn't like Fieros, he's history, but if he likes Fieros but just had a bad experience, he'll be back sooner or later.||||reg||1
