Z||000014||LT1 Chop Top||10-27-2001||08:13 PM||||That is interesting...<P>What exactly was he using my Chop Top Video to prove?<P>I have gotten several 'hate' emails for people saying that the Chop Top is 'on its last legs' (actually only had 13.5k miles on it) and that the video was "no Big Friggin Deal", my 3800 is better, my Turbo is better....  <P>What I don't get is that I ONLY posted the URL to my page on Fiero related media.  PFF, Fiero Technet, and Fiero Digest.  Why do some people supposedly in Fieros trash others rides??  I have NEVER trashed anyone elses ride, especially if it was a fiero!  Hell, I'd love to have an 84, just to have one.<P>My first reaction is to blast away at these people, but then I suppose I really don't care.  When I bought the Chop Top, I didn't do it with anyone else in mind.||||reg||1
Z||000015||SLYGUY||10-27-2001||11:53 PM||||I agree with you LT1. <P>Try to remember that the people that flamed you for that video clip don't fully understand what they are looking at.<BR> <BR>Most people don't know that the engine is in the middle of car, and that theFiero was the USAs only mid-engine car. There was never a V8 engine from the factory either. Oh, and there isn't a stock Fiero that would burn rubber like yours did or sound as great as that when it was doin' it.<P>Don't loose a wink of sleep over it. <BR>Party on and keep those videos coming!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Sly<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000016||TRiAD||10-28-2001||12:54 AM||||LT1 Chop Top, I posted the video, asking people on our local forum to "tell me again what's wrong with Fieros"...<P>I was making a point that yours is what they can all aspire to be. <P>Sly, the Fiero is NOT the USs only MR car, the Vector is onle one of a few cars it shares this distinction with. (Vector W8, Vector Aeromotive, Vector Avtech, Vector M12...try a search, this is an awesome car!)<P>Anyway, thanks guys! I'm going to be taking some flack for a while, I appreciate your support. ||||reg||1
